# sysc-greet README tour (v1.3.0, laptop testbench, 1920x1080).
# Each step must start after the previous step's keys finish; tour.py checks this.
#
# Opening state (= closing state): Tokyo Night, Minimal border, frosted form (record-tour.sh
# passes --form-mode frosted), bspwm session, shared header index 5, no background.
#
# Menu facts (every submenu opens at row 0):
#   F1 main menu: Close Menu, Themes, Borders, Backgrounds
#   Themes (Enter selects and closes): Back, Follow sysc-shell, Dracula, Catppuccin,
#     Nord, Tokyo Night 5, Gruvbox, Material, Solarized, Monochrome 9,
#     TransIsHardJob, Eldritch 11, RAMA 12
#   Backgrounds (Space toggles, one at a time; Esc Esc closes): Back, Fire 1,
#     ASCII Rain, Matrix 3, ..., AK-47 9, Australian SLR 10, Higgs Field 11,
#     Laocoon 18, Napoleon Bust 19, Roman Gladiator 16, Engel 22, Lion Statue 27, F-14 Tomcat 28
#   Sessions on the laptop (filename order, X11 first): bspwm 0, Cinnamon 1-2, Qtile 3-4,
#     Xfce 5, Cinnamon Wayland 6, dwl 7, GNOME 8, Hyprland uwsm 9, Hyprland 10, Mango 11,
#     Niri 12, Plasma 13, Qtile Wayland 14-15, River 16, Sway 17, sysc-compositor 18,
#     Weston 19, Xfce Wayland 20. Tab focuses the session field; Up/Down then switch
#     sessions with no dropdown on screen.
#   Borders (Enter selects and closes): Back, Classic 1, Modern 2, Minimal 3, ASCII-1 4,
#     ASCII-2 5, NFO 01 6, NFO 02 7, NFO 03 8, Braille Hairline 9, Sextant Bevel 10
#   PgDn steps the header variant; the index is shared by all sessions and wraps to 0
#     past the current session's last variant. Mango: ascii_1-5 ANSI, ascii_6-12 ASCII.
#     Hyprland: ascii_1-10 ANSI, ascii_11-27 ASCII.
# Models: picked by how they read at README width (AK-47, Australian SLR, Lowe, St George,
#   Brandenburg Gate, Jesus Christ Statue and F-22 read poorly).


# Lead-in, trimmed from the video: shared header index on ascii_6, session bspwm (top).
0.50   keys@0.3 pgdn pgdn pgdn pgdn pgdn
2.20   keys tab
2.40   keys@0.1 up up up up up up up up up up up
3.60   keys tab
4.60   mark start

# Rapid compositor flip from the top of the session list: field focused, no menu on screen.

# Duplicate entries (second Cinnamon, Qtile and Qtile Wayland, Cinnamon on Wayland, Hyprland uwsm) pass quickly.
5.20   keys tab
5.40   keys down
5.68   keys down
5.76   keys down
6.04   keys down
6.12   keys down
6.40   keys down
6.48   keys down
6.76   keys down
7.04   keys down
7.12   keys down
7.40   keys down
7.68   keys down
7.96   keys down
8.24   keys down
8.32   keys down
8.40   keys down
8.68   keys down
8.96   keys down
9.24   keys down

# Quick scroll back up to Mango: its themed ASCII header (ascii_6) sits behind the backgrounds.
9.52   keys@0.06 up up up up up up up up

# Classic backgrounds over the frosted form on the Minimal border: Fire, then Matrix.
10.74  keys@0.12 f1 down down down enter
11.42  keys down
11.62  expect Fire
11.82  keys space esc esc
14.17  keys@0.12 f1 down down down enter
14.85  keys down down down
15.45  expect Matrix
15.65  keys space esc esc

# Higgs field: leave time for the particle field to develop.
18.00  keys@0.12 f1 down down down enter
18.68  keys@0.06 down down down down down down down down down down down
19.48  expect Higgs Field
19.68  keys space esc esc

# Rotating models, in descending menu order.
24.00  keys@0.12 f1 down down down enter
24.68  keys@0.06 down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down
26.44  expect F-14 Tomcat
26.64  keys space esc esc
29.09  keys@0.12 f1 down down down enter
29.77  keys@0.06 down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down
31.47  expect Lion Statue
31.67  keys space esc esc
34.12  keys@0.12 f1 down down down enter
34.80  keys@0.06 down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down
36.20  expect Engel
36.40  keys space esc esc
38.85  keys@0.12 f1 down down down enter
39.53  keys@0.06 down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down
40.75  expect Napoleon Bust
40.95  keys space esc esc
43.40  keys@0.12 f1 down down down enter
44.08  keys@0.06 down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down
45.24  expect Laocoon and His Sons
45.44  keys space esc esc
47.89  keys@0.12 f1 down down down enter
48.57  keys@0.06 down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down
49.61  expect Roman Gladiator
49.81  keys space esc esc

# Roman Gladiator off: plain background for the header art.
52.26  keys@0.12 f1 down down down enter
52.94  keys@0.06 down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down
53.98  expect Roman Gladiator
54.18  keys space esc esc

# Hyprland only: one row up from Mango with the field focused, then page through its art.
55.23  keys up
55.63  keys@0.35 pgdn pgdn pgdn pgdn pgdn pgdn pgdn pgdn

# Mango only: PgDn normalizes the stale Hyprland index to 0, then advances to ascii_6.
58.58  keys down
58.98  keys@0.45 pgdn pgdn pgdn pgdn pgdn

# Themes on the ASCII header, ending on the opening Tokyo Night.
61.83  keys@0.12 f1 down enter
62.27  keys@0.06 down down down down down down down down down down down down
63.13  expect Theme: RAMA
63.33  keys enter
63.93  keys@0.12 f1 down enter
64.37  keys@0.06 down down down down down down down down down down down
65.17  expect Theme: Eldritch
