66.41  keys@0.06 down down down down down down down down down
67.09  expect Theme: Monochrome
67.29  keys enter
67.89  keys@0.12 f1 down enter
68.33  keys@0.06 down down down down down
68.77  expect Theme: Tokyo Night
68.97  keys enter

