80.41  keys@0.06 down down down down down down down
80.97  expect Style: NFO 02
81.17  keys enter
82.12  keys@0.12 f1 down down enter
82.68  keys@0.06 down down down down down down down down
83.30  expect Style: NFO 03
83.50  keys enter
84.45  keys@0.12 f1 down down enter
85.01  keys@0.06 down down down down down down down down down
85.69  expect Style: Braille Hairline
85.89  keys enter
86.84  keys@0.12 f1 down down enter
